    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100442" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνευδοκ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>join in approving, give one's consent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demad.
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				7.1.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				712.46
			</span></i> (Crete, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>, 
				Dor.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιόντων</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGrenf.</u>
				2.26.25
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				22.20
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνευδοκέοντος τοῦ
			δεῖνα</span>, in forms of sale, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				1532a4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1555a5
			</span></i> (Delph.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. dat. rei, <i>consent</i> or <i>agree to</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ma.</u>
				1.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1644.27
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1731.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				11.48
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. dat.
			pers., <i>agree</i> or <i>sympathize with . . ,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ep.Rom.
				1.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνευδοκήθην</span> in signf. <i><span class="en">
				1.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				18.49
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅκκα [τὰ μέρεα] . . συνευδοκῆται
					ἀλλάλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theag.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				3.1.117
			</span></i>.</div>
